@@name
refactor
@@description
Restructure the code named in the user request without changing its observable behaviour.
@@requirements
    - Establish a behavioural baseline first: run the relevant tests and record the results
    - Update every caller and reference, including tests, docs and configuration
    - Behaviour after the change is identical to the baseline
@@approach
    Before editing, reason through:
    - The full set of call sites and references (search the repository for each renamed or moved symbol)
    - An order of small, individually verifiable steps
    Commit to that order and verify after each step.
@@verification
    - Search the repository for the old names or paths and confirm no stale references remain
@@constraints
    - No behaviour changes, bug fixes or new features mixed into the refactor
    - Do not change public interfaces unless the request explicitly asks for it
@@out-of-scope
    - Performance tuning or style changes beyond what the request names
